    <subfield code="a">Wrist-cuff structure of gathered pages. Laser printed paper pages. Hinged sterling silver wire with silk and pellon fabric. Hand-made button and cord closure. Housed in cardboard box (23 x 30 x 6 cm.)</subfield>
